UNIT ringToken
KIND FUNCTIONAL
FIDELITY spec
SIG ringToken(items, gate) -> Promise<Array>
# A ring whose single circulating permission is EXPLICIT on the boundary.
RING the token is taken once, passed hand to hand, and released at the end
INVARIANT SAFETY: R_ring subset of R_free — the ring invents no outcome
INVARIANT LIVENESS (mutual exclusion): at most ONE holder at any instant
INVARIANT LIVENESS (no loss): every token taken is eventually released
